    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid DP - count paths</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/unique-paths/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 62</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Unique Paths</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every path into a cell arrives from above or from the left, so ways(r, c) = ways(r-1, c) + ways(r, c-1); one rolling row gives O(m·n) time and O(n) space. Or count words of (m-1) D's and (n-1) R's: C(m+n-2, m-1) in O(min(m, n)).</p>\n"
